  "description": "Add as much (or as little) lime and hot sauce to this light, savory beer drink as you want.",
  "notes": "Optional or for serving: Tajín or other chile-salt blend (optional; see note)\n\nOptional substitutions: Kosher salt → sea salt\n\nNotes: You can either do a classic salt rim for this drink or rim the drink with a chile-salt mix, using a brand like Tajín.\nIf you want a less tart version of the drink, experiment with using less lime juice—1 or 1 1/2 ounces can work, too. You can also make a less spicy version by reducing the hot sauce from two teaspoons to one.",
